                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">a8c5b098-3d73-4609-8086-497f00b42554</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">04 frame polilinea assi svincoli</item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Una polilinea genera tre travi. Sezione con punto d'inserimento, asse locale verso un punto, svincolo torsionale finale e cambio proprieta'.
Beam Behaviour permette Beam / Truss / Cable. Qui rimane Beam: Truss e Cable non sostengono flessione.
Unita': m, kN, kPa, tonne, C. Leggere gli input e i pannelli; valori dimostrativi modificabili.</item>
                  </items>
